...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

openrouter: OpenRouter { class: ext }
agent: Surelock Homes { class: ours }
google: Google Maps { class: ext }

openrouter -> agent: tool_call get_street_view
agent -> google: GET streetview/metadata×4방향
google -> agent: capture_date + image_bytes
agent -> openrouter: tool 결과: images_captured
openrouter -> agent: tool_call get_places_info
agent -> google: findplacefromtext→place/details
google -> agent: business_status·rating·reviews
agent -> openrouter: tool 결과: place 정보
